websiteprivacy='''<div class="wrap"><header class="page-intro"><p class="eyebrow">Oberasoftware Publishing</p><h1>Website privacy.</h1><p class="lead">What happens when you visit these publisher pages.</p><p class="updated">Updated 24 November 2026</p></header><article class="document"><h2>Scope</h2><p>This policy covers the Oberasoftware Publishing homepage and the new product, support and privacy pages on www.oberasoftware.com. Haven Under Fire has a separate <a href="/haven-under-fire/privacy/">game privacy policy</a>. Older project documentation and external services linked from this site may have different practices.</p><h2>No tracking added by us</h2><p>These publisher pages do not use advertising, analytics, cookies, local storage, embedded social widgets or external fonts. Viewing a screenshot does not send a feedback report or create an account.</p><h2>Hosting with GitHub Pages</h2><p>GitHub Pages serves this website. GitHub records visitor IP addresses for security, whether or not you are signed in to GitHub. See <a href="https://docs.github.com/en/pages/getting-started-with-github-pages/what-is-github-pages#data-collection">GitHub’s hosting documentation</a> and its <a href="https://docs.github.com/en/site-policy/privacy-policies/github-general-privacy-statement">Privacy Statement</a>.</p><h2>Contacting us</h2><p>Email links open your email application. If you send us a message, we receive the contact details and information you choose to include, and use them to respond. Please do not include passwords or payment-card information. Email <a href="mailto:support@oberasoftware.com">support@oberasoftware.com</a> about your correspondence or to request its deletion.</p><h2>Links to other services</h2><p>Apple handles App Store purchases. GitHub hosts code, issues and documentation. When you follow a link to one of these services, its privacy practices apply. We do not collect your Apple Account credentials or payment-card details through this website.</p><h2>Publisher</h2><p>Oberasoftware, presented as Oberasoftware Publishing.<br><a href="mailto:support@oberasoftware.com">support@oberasoftware.com</a></p></article></div>'''
